  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridging the education gap in Venezuela</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will work with local, community-led organisations in Venezuela to reduce the education gap that has resulted from many years of complex humanitarian crisis, and has been further compounded by the pandemic.  By providing incentives to stay in school, resources and training to improve the quality of education that kids receive, and opportunities beyond school, we will improve attendance, achievement, and aspirations. Because these children are the future. And they deserve a future.</narrative>
  </description>
